[{"title":"为何翙高兵部藻翔题象山图 其一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"裨瀛大海四围环，半在虚无缥缈间。\n天戴尧时州禹迹，分明认取自家山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13379,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为何翙高兵部藻翔题象山图 其二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"叩门海客偶谈瀛，发箧《阴符》或论兵。\n糜尽虫少剩猿鹤，拭乾残泪说闲情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13380,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为何翙高兵部藻翔题象山图 其三","author":"黄遵宪","text":"说教袄神方造塔，讹言王母又行筹。\n年来洗耳胸无事，一味贪眠看水鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13381,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为何翙高兵部藻翔题象山图 其四","author":"黄遵宪","text":"《十七史》从何处说，茫茫《六合》赋何愚。\n骑驴倒看云烟过，只好商量入画图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13382,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬曾重伯编修 其一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"诗笔韩黄万丈光，湘乡相国故堂堂。\n谁知东鲁传家学，竟异南丰一瓣香。\n上接孟荀驺论纵，旁通《骚》赋楚歌狂。\n沣兰沅芷无穷竟，况复哀时重自伤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13383,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上黄鹤楼","author":"黄遵宪","text":"矶头黄鹄日东流，又此阑干又此秋。\n鼾睡他人同卧榻，婆娑老子自登楼。\n能言鹦鹉悲名士，折翼天鹏概督州。\n洒尽新亭楚囚泪，烟波风景总生愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13384,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上岳阳楼","author":"黄遵宪","text":"巍峨雄关据上游，重湖八百望中收。\n当心忽压秦头日，画地难分禹迹州。\n从古荆蛮原小丑，即今砥柱孰中流。\n红髯碧眼知何意，挈镜来登最上头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13385,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长沙吊买谊宅","author":"黄遵宪","text":"寒林日薄井波平，人去犹闻太息声。\n楚庙欲呼天再问，湘流空吊水无情。\n儒生首出通时务，年少群惊压老成。\n百世为君犹洒泪，奇才何况并时生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13386,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书愤 其一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"一自珠崖弃，纷纷各效尤。\n瓜分惟客听，薪尽向予求。\n秦楚纵横日，幽燕十六州。\n未闻南北海，处处扼咽喉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13387,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书愤 其二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"岂欲亲豺虎，联交约近攻。\n如何盟白马，无故卖卢龙？\n一着棋全败，连环结不穷。\n四邻墙有耳，言早泄诸戎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13388,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书愤 其三","author":"黄遵宪","text":"扰扰无穷事，吁嗟景教行。\n乍闻袄庙火，已见德车旌。\n过重牵牛罚，横光啮犬争。\n挟强图一逞，莫问出师名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13389,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书愤 其四","author":"黄遵宪","text":"古有羁縻地，今称隃领州。\n竟闻秦失鹿，转使鲁无鸠。\n地动山移恐，天悬日坠尤。\n君看黑奴国，到此属何洲？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13390,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书愤 其五","author":"黄遵宪","text":"弱肉供强食，人人虎口危。\n无边画瓯脱，有地尽华离。\n争问三分鼎，横张十字旗。\n波兰与天竺，后患更谁知？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13391,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"支离","author":"黄遵宪","text":"举鼎膑先绝，支离笑此身。\n穷途竟何世，馀事且诗人。\n技悔屠龙拙，时惊叹蜡新。\n剖胸倾执血，恐化大千尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13392,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪事","author":"黄遵宪","text":"贯索星连熠熠光，穹庐天盖暮苍苍。\n秋风鼓吹妃呼豨，夜雨铃声劬秃当。\n《十七史》从何处说，百年债看后来偿。\n森森画戟重围柝，坐觉今宵漏较长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13393,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"放归","author":"黄遵宪","text":"绛帕焚香读道书，屡烦促报讯何如。\n佛前影怖楼枝鸽，海外波惊涸辙鱼。\n此地可能容复壁？\n无人肯就问箯舆。\n玉关杨柳辽河月，却载春风到旧庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13394,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九月朔日启程由上海归舟中作","author":"黄遵宪","text":"月黑霜凝点客衣，寥天雁影乍南飞。\n一池水问干何事，万里风劳远送归。\n测镜回看星贯索，解装待问石支机。\n旁人莫误三能望，遥指银潢望紫微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13395,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"到家","author":"黄遵宪","text":"处处风波到日迟，病身憔悴尚能支。\n少眠易醒藏蕉梦，多难仍逢剪韭时。\n大海走鳗寻有迹，老翁失马卜难知。\n援琴欲鼓《拘幽操》，月在中天天四垂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13396,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"授受元辰纪上仪，帝尧训政典留贻。\n谁知高后垂帘事，又见成王负扆时。\n九鼎齐鸣惊雉雊，千金悬格购龙医。\n白头父老纷传说，上溯乾嘉泪欲垂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13397,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"上变飞腾赤白囊，两端首鼠疾奔忙。\n刚闻赤板连名奏，便召长枪第六郎。\n驰骑锁门谋大索，屯桥阻水伺非常。\n珠襦武帐诸臣侍，亟诏明晨幸未央。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13398,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其三","author":"黄遵宪","text":"推车弄顶看文康，变态真如傀儡场。\n五百控弦谋劫制，一丸进药失先尝。\n传书信口诃西母，改制称尊托素王。\n九死一生仍脱走，头颅声价重天亡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13399,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其四","author":"黄遵宪","text":"金瓯亲卜比公卿，领取冰衔十日荣。\n东市朝衣真不测，南山铁案竟无名。\n芝焚蕙叹嗟僚友，李代桃僵泣弟兄。\n闻道诟天兼骂贼，好头谁斫未分明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13400,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其五","author":"黄遵宪","text":"父子相从泣狱扉，老翁七十荷征衣。\n一家草索看生缚，三寸桐棺待死归。\n凿空虚槎疑汉使，涉江奇服怨湘妃。\n可怜时后才无几，瓜蔓抄来摘更稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13401,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其六","author":"黄遵宪","text":"下诏会宜母子离，初闻逐谏后苔儿。\n心肝谁奉藏衣诏？\n骨肉难徵对簿词。\n一网打馀高鸟尽，九泉曲处蛰龙知。\n恩牛怨李原无与，莫误忠奸读党碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13402,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其七","author":"黄遵宪","text":"师未多鱼遂漏言，如何此事竟推袁？\n柏人谁白孱王罪？\n改子终伤慈母恩。\n金玦厖凉含隐痛，杯弓蛇影负奇冤。\n五洲变法都流血，先累维新案尽翻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13403,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事 其八","author":"黄遵宪","text":"太白星芒月色寒，五云缥缈望长安。\n忍言赤县神州祸，更觉黄人捧日难。\n压己真尤天梦梦，穷途并哭海漫漫。\n是非新旧纷无定，君看寒蝉噤众官。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13404,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人境庐之邻有屋数间余购取其地葺而新之有楼岿然独立无壁南武山人为书一联曰陆沈欲借舟权住天问翻无壁受呵因足成之","author":"黄遵宪","text":"半世浮槎梦里过，归来随地觅行窝。\n陆沈欲借舟权住，天问翻无壁受呵。\n偶引雏孙问初月，且容时辈量汪波。\n湾湾几曲青溪水，可有人寻到钓蓑？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13405,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寒夜独坐卧虹榭","author":"黄遵宪","text":"今时何时我非我，中夜起坐心旁皇。\n风声水声乌乌武，日出月出团团黄。\n层阴压屋天四盖，寒云入户山两当。\n回头下视九州窄，高飞黄鹄今何方？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13406,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小饮息亭醉后作","author":"黄遵宪","text":"斜日江波听鹧鸪，鹧鸪啼处是吾卢。\n酒酣仍作思乡梦，径仄难为《益地图》。\n偶约故人同茗艼，居然丈室坐莲须。\n朝朝捧牍应官去，忽忆吴江老钓徒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13407,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仰天","author":"黄遵宪","text":"仰天击缶唱乌乌，拍遍阑干碎唾壶。\n病久忍摩新髀肉，劫余惊抚好头颅。\n箧藏名士株连籍，壁挂群雄豆剖图。\n敢托鸩媒从凤驾，自排阊阖拨云呼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13408,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁","author":"黄遵宪","text":"汝亦惊弦者，来归过我庐。\n可能沧海外，代寄故人书？\n四面犹张网，孤飞未定居。\n匆匆还不暇，他莫问何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13409,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬刘子岩同年瑛","author":"黄遵宪","text":"铁汉楼高天四垂，岭云愁护党人碑。\n看花每溅啼鹃泪，绕树难安飞鸟枝。\n何地可名清净土？\n思君忽到太平时。\n一家乐寿兼文福，呼聿吟书买写诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13410,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"我是东西南北人，平生自号风波民。\n百年过半洲游四，留得家园五十春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13411,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"亦曾忍死须臾坐，正用此时持事来。\n今午垂帘春睡起，拥垆拈箸拨寒灰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13412,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三","author":"黄遵宪","text":"自携蜡屐自扶筇，偶亦偕行挈小童。\n积习未除官样俗，袖中藏得歙烟筒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13413,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其四","author":"黄遵宪","text":"斜阳桥背立移时，偶有人过偶颔之。\n商略雨晴旋散去，不曾相识亦忘谁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13414,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其五","author":"黄遵宪","text":"云中水火界相争，相触相磨便作声。\n此是寻常推阻力，人间浪作震雷惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13415,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其六","author":"黄遵宪","text":"跳珠雨乱黑云翻，事外闲云却自闲。\n看到须臾图万变，终愁累却自家山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13416,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其七","author":"黄遵宪","text":"老健真应饱看山，看山谁得几时闲？\n屡将游约诳猿鹤，迟恐山灵笑汝孱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13417,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其八","author":"黄遵宪","text":"梦回小坐泪潸然，已误流光五十年。\n但有去来无现在，无穷生灭看香烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13418,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其九","author":"黄遵宪","text":"日光野马息相吹，夜气沈沈万籁微。\n真到无闻无见地，众虫仍着鼻端飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13419,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十","author":"黄遵宪","text":"抛书午倦睡醒时，走听盲翁负鼓词。\n漫说是非身后误，上场人事类儿嬉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13420,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"天下英雄聊种菜，山中高士爱锄瓜。\n无心我却如云懒，偶尔栽花偶看花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13421,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"费尽黄金匝地铺，算来十笏只区区。\n无端尚被西邻责，何况商量《益地图》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13422,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十三","author":"黄遵宪","text":"曲阑十步九徘徊，三面轩窗四扇开。\n夸道华严弹指现，只怜无地着楼台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13423,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十四","author":"黄遵宪","text":"墙外垂杨尽别家，平分水竹颇争差。\n万花烂漫他年事，第一安排旋复花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十五","author":"黄遵宪","text":"无端苞拆复挼莎，误尽人非郭橐驼。\n甫见萌芽生意尽，对花负负奈花何！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十六","author":"黄遵宪","text":"忍向当门再种兰，露翻风打莫重看。\n思量空谷安身好，犹恐他时画地难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十七","author":"黄遵宪","text":"秋淫天漏雨萧萧，展叶抽条各自骄。\n同作绿阴同蔽日，如何修竹肯弹蕉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十八","author":"黄遵宪","text":"略买胭脂画折枝，明窗护以璧琉璃。\n物从中国名从主，绿比波薐红荔支。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十九","author":"黄遵宪","text":"絮棉吹入化春衣，渡海山藷足疗饥。\n一任转输无内外，物情先见大同时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十","author":"黄遵宪","text":"乳草删除缘几美，旧花别换日新红。\n去留一一旧天择，物自争存我大公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"农事传家稷世官，可知粒食出艰难。\n妄夸天降忘人力，转当寒冰覆翼看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"三千年上旧花枝，颇怪风人不入诗。\n我向秦时明月问，古时花可似今时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十三","author":"黄遵宪","text":"移桃接李尽成春，果硕花浓树愈新。\n难怪球西新辟地，白人换尽旧红人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十四","author":"黄遵宪","text":"筚路桃弧展转迁，南来远过一千年。\n方言足证中原韵，礼俗犹留三代前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十五","author":"黄遵宪","text":"男执干戈女甲裳，八千子弟走勤王。\n崖山舟覆沙虫尽，重带天来再破荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十六","author":"黄遵宪","text":"野外团焦岭上田，世传三十子孙千。\n元时古墓明朝屋，上覆榕阴六百年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十七","author":"黄遵宪","text":"宰相表行多谱牒，大宗法废变祠堂。\n犹存九两系民意，宗约家家法几章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十八","author":"黄遵宪","text":"世守先姑《德象》篇，人多《列女传》中贤。\n若倡男女同权论，合授周婆制礼权。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十九","author":"黄遵宪","text":"窅娘侧足跛行苦，楚国纤腰饿死多。\n说向妆台供媚妾，人人含笑看梨涡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十","author":"黄遵宪","text":"反哺难期妇乳姑，系缨竟占女从夫。\n双双锦褓鸳鸯小，绝好朱陈嫁娶图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十一","author":"黄遵宪","text":"一声声道妹相思，夜月哀猿和《竹枝》。\n欢是团圆悲是别，总应肠断妃呼豨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"华灯挂壁祝添丁，吉梦徵兰笑语馨。\n日问神游到何处，佛前别供《处胎经》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十三","author":"黄遵宪","text":"海国能医山国贫，万夫荷锸转金轮。\n最怜一二虬髯客，手举扶余赠别人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十四","author":"黄遵宪","text":"秀孝都居弟子行，人人《阴骘》诵文昌。\n迩来《云笈》传抄贵，更写惊经拜玉皇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十五","author":"黄遵宪","text":"枯骨如龟识吉凶，孤埋鸠占不相容。\n一年讼牒如山积，不为疑龙即撼龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十六","author":"黄遵宪","text":"螺壳漫山纸蝶飞，携雏扶老语依依。\n红罗散影铜萧响，知是谁家扫墓归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十七","author":"黄遵宪","text":"老树楼鸦子又孙，青青松柏半为薪。\n眼中酒化杯中泪，拜手今承主祭人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十八","author":"黄遵宪","text":"恨无永叔《泷冈表》，亦愧羲之《誓墓文》。\n说甚微官邀薄禄，纸钱在地酒浇坟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十九","author":"黄遵宪","text":"树静风停梦不成，枕函侧倚泪纵横。\n荷荷引睡施施溺，竟夕闻娘唤女声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其四十","author":"黄遵宪","text":"黄鹄都非五尺童，日催人老日龙钟。\n呼名摩顶回头道，两颊差如百几翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":13450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]